License status for this archive
================================

No public reuse license is granted by this revision bundle unless a separate rights holder later replaces this file with an explicit license.

The archive is provided as a revisioned research and governance object. Copying, redistribution, modification, or public reuse outside the user's authorized workflow requires explicit permission from the relevant rights holder.

This restrictive placeholder is intentional. It avoids silently assigning a permissive license to papers, artifacts, or governance material whose final licensing decision has not been recorded.
